OL,3,AThree children and a teacher killed by
OL,4,A16-year-old at Oregon primary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old fatally shot three
OL,7,Fchildren and a teacher at a primary
OL,8,Fschool in the US state of Oregon before
OL,9,Fhe was killed by a bystander.
OL,11,FThe unnamed attacker forced his way
OL,12,Finto Silver Rail Elementary School in
OL,13,Fthe US city of Bend on Thursday
OL,14,Fafternoon by shooting at locked doors,
OL,15,Fpolice said.
OL,17,FBend Police Chief Mike Krantz said the
OL,18,Fteen was shot dead by "a community
OL,19,Fmember who had seen the suspect enter
OL,20,Fthe school and pursued him into the
OL,21,Fschool and engaged him".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
